 ["GENERATED by tools/Tools/Variances.lean from the vendored Effect sources.",
  "Regenerate: python3 scripts/generate.py --only variances",
  "Declaration-site variance as rc.112 spells it (decisions row 55). `variance` is co for `out`, contra for `in`, inv for `in out`, none for a parameter with no modifier, and inferred for a type alias of a union, whose constituents' declarations are carried beside it.",
